  "summary_en": "Beijing's local regulations, adopted 31 December 2024 and effective 1 April 2025, promote and regulate autonomous vehicle innovation. They set a staged pathway from road testing and demonstration to pilot operation, with safety assessment, safety operators, cybersecurity and data rules, insurance, and fines for violations.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Staged pathway: road testing, demonstration application, safety assessment, then road application pilots requiring qualification",
   "Allows personal autonomous passenger cars listed in the national vehicle catalogue",
   "Requires safety operators and platform monitors able to take over control",
   "Manufacturers bear product-quality responsibility and must meet functional safety, cybersecurity and data security obligations",
